      "text": "Traffic Advisory\n\nIn view of the “Sagar Wali Qawali Bharat Tour Delhi” at Indira Gandhi Indoor Stadium (Main Arena KDJW), traffic restrictions & diversions will be in place on 08.06.2025 (Sunday) from 12:00 PM to Midnight. Key stretches like IP Marg (MGM Road), Vikas Marg, and Ring Road (Rajghat to IP Depot) may be affected.\n\nKindly follow the advisory.\n\n#DPTrafficAdvisory",
